o relieve boredom during the journey. They may provide rewards or exchange contact information after the journey to become your friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > (Animal companions) Various small animals appear randomly and can interact and become friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > (Personalized random character, open AI chat) He/she/it may become your partner. The length of time is up to you. No matter what, at least we have met each other before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928500/extras/8d86ea67763f8ccfa4d06425dc4a62a8.avif?t=1741500533\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Possible future development content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customized NPC characters (personality, experience, hobbies...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customized vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customized map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The above content can be modded into the creative workshop</p></li></ul>",
